      "idea": "逐词识别价格并替换。",
      "steps": [
        "按单空格 split",
        "valid=长度>1、首字符$、其余均 digit",
        "valid 时 price=parseLong(rest)，discounted=price*(100-discount)/100.0，格式化 $%.2f",
        "以空格 join"
